Wrong (A): $150,000 is the Year 1 ending balance before applying Year 2 activity; it fails to incorporate the Year 2 accrual and claims.
Wrong (C): $300,000 represents only the Year 2 accrual without considering the beginning balance or claims paid during Year 2.
