  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under ASC 855-10-25, this is a Type II (nonrecognized) subsequent event because the injury -- the cause of action -- occurred on February 5, Year 2, after the December 31, Year 1 balance sheet date. Conditions giving rise to the loss did not exist at the reporting date, so no adjustment is made to Year 1 financial statements.
Wrong (B): The relevant date is when the underlying event occurred, not when the lawsuit was filed; the filing date does not determine the reporting period.
