Wrong (A): The acquiree''s probability assessment is irrelevant under ASC 805; business combination accounting requires fair value recognition independent of ASC 450 thresholds.
Wrong (C): The ASC 450 minimum-of-range rule does not apply in business combinations; ASC 805 requires fair value measurement using probability weighting.
