Wrong (B): Level 1 requires unadjusted quoted prices for the identical instrument in an active market; a constructed yield curve is derived from but not identical to exchange-traded contract prices.
Wrong (C): Using a model to construct the yield curve does not make the inputs Level 3 when the underlying data is publicly available and observable.
